# Cloudflare Pages Routes Configuration
# Controls routing between static assets and Worker

/api/*    cloudflare_workers
/admin/*  cloudflare_workers
/static/*  cache_override
/assets/*  cache_override
/_next/static/*  cache_override
/_next/image/*  cache_override
/favicon.ico  cache_override
/robots.txt  cache_override
/sitemap.xml  cache_override
/*  cloudflare_workers
